64659752124", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75630198_2577186362552498_3913228803140222976_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cz9NnFtGL1EQ7kNvwEWiZd3&_nc_oc=AdqTmG4XQMR8k0aPbo6YM2n8e-mvH6ruPbI3SRMdYTJOzV1AUE-FH63UvGdVUtOFxv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD1WnStGktlo4BZsnVau7IYJE8b2b-5vP6oyYZPrPtS1w&oe=6A5B67DD"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "561784124443343", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458099_2270787786557926_9182956901405556736_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3bEEsU9xUf0Q7kNvwGIkMQO&_nc_oc=Adr9riWyy-4-rvCgut_WbIf9qz91uXyZRN_bs-n2PBDF4Mdqc9bACvhmDiP-Oq87a6A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAKsSD7HTsmP26aV3mx0OxggT39mSRXbp_YeBOewdxIHQ&oe=6A5B7137"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "224781318713799", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031393_523290235257100_254597187336404992_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lGEbzCqXV3wQ7kNvwHNR81V&_nc_oc=AdrzVa-4Htnvm-qKi_lremuDLvfJs0tLfvBAuTEO8IVb3nwACbSy41vrTfAFr57cQgs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCIaU8GVppy-2Fu4GT-wNuyOoQo9laH5tOzEc7dhhTcZQ&oe=6A5B5ED6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Roller Coaster - Epic Bat Shooting Game", "keywords": ["Epic", "Roller", "Coaster", "Shooting", "Game"], "long_description": "Ready to experience the real adventure of Epic Roller Coaster with a new feature of bat shooting? Indulge in one of the most refined, immersive and energetic VR coasters you\u2019ve ever seen!\nIf you don\u2019t want to go for a most spooky adventure, then you can also enjoy the peaceful ride of Fantasy Roller Coaster! \nThere are 3 modes to have the fun of Epic Roller Coaster:\n1.\tSimple Peaceful Ride\n2.\tHaving Controls on Speed \n3.\tBat Shooting Mode\n\nIf you have any feedback, feel free to share. More and long